283
00:18:01,419 --> 00:18:02,959
Warden, Warden, he's our man.

284
00:18:03,039 --> 00:18:04,439
Now he's finally out the cab.

285
00:18:04,939 --> 00:18:06,579
Warden, Warden, go!

286
00:18:07,099 --> 00:18:07,519
Go!

287
00:18:07,979 --> 00:18:08,319
Yeah!

288
00:18:08,839 --> 00:18:12,279
Vice Warden, we need to get to level four.

289
00:18:12,539 --> 00:18:13,399
Enough cheering.

290
00:18:13,399 --> 00:18:20,599
This is it!

291
00:18:20,799 --> 00:18:22,759
We can't fight him without the Demon Guards!

292
00:18:22,979 --> 00:18:23,779
We're screwed!

293
00:18:24,039 --> 00:18:25,159
All speed ahead.

294
00:18:25,319 --> 00:18:26,879
Nothing can stop us now.

295
00:18:27,139 --> 00:18:27,519
Crap!

296
00:18:27,699 --> 00:18:29,479
It seems like their numbers are increasing too.

297
00:18:29,479 --> 00:18:29,799
Crap!

298
00:18:35,799 --> 00:18:37,279
It's Team Guard Sadie!

299
00:18:37,399 --> 00:18:37,999
Who cares?

300
00:18:38,219 --> 00:18:39,299
Put you out of the way!

301
00:18:39,599 --> 00:18:40,099
Can it!

302
00:18:40,099 --> 00:18:41,799
And that's Mistress Sadie!

303
00:18:42,119 --> 00:18:43,459
Manifesto of Excitement!

304
00:18:43,759 --> 00:18:44,959
Red Viper Whip!

305
00:18:46,359 --> 00:18:47,759
How dare you!

306
00:18:49,399 --> 00:18:51,099
Beat on my sweet little...

307
00:18:52,379 --> 00:18:55,099
Minions!

308
00:19:03,099 --> 00:19:04,379
Crazy lady!

309
00:19:05,279 --> 00:19:05,719
