310
00:19:07,299 --> 00:19:09,599
Boy, I told you to keep moving, didn't I?

311
00:19:09,599 --> 00:19:11,059
Hee-haw!

312
00:19:13,839 --> 00:19:15,019
Listen up, you.

313
00:19:15,179 --> 00:19:17,479
You're fighting me now, naughty girl.

314
00:19:17,759 --> 00:19:18,639
Naughty girl?

315
00:19:19,659 --> 00:19:22,099
You will refer to me as Mistress Sadie.

316
00:19:23,219 --> 00:19:25,159
Emporial female hormone.

317
00:19:28,859 --> 00:19:30,859
You know, sometimes...

318
00:19:30,859 --> 00:19:32,819
I like a girl fight!

319
00:19:34,879 --> 00:19:36,179
Stupid anarchist.

320
00:19:36,319 --> 00:19:38,279
So you're a woman, like I care.

321
00:19:38,279 --> 00:19:39,639
Make up your mind.

322
00:19:39,639 --> 00:19:40,179
Ugh!

323
00:19:40,679 --> 00:19:41,179
Pest!

324
00:19:42,719 --> 00:19:44,099
Oh, sweetie.

325
00:19:47,199 --> 00:19:49,019
Jealousy doesn't suit you.

326
00:19:49,019 --> 00:19:50,019
Mwah!

327
00:19:55,159 --> 00:19:56,099
Level one.

328
00:19:56,479 --> 00:19:57,199
What's going on?

329
00:19:57,619 --> 00:19:58,819
Have you apprehended Blackbeard?

330
00:19:59,799 --> 00:20:00,279
Answer me.

331
00:20:00,359 --> 00:20:00,799
What's wrong?

332
00:20:01,019 --> 00:20:01,579
Say something.

333
00:20:02,379 --> 00:20:04,479
Seems that fortune favors us.

334
00:20:04,659 --> 00:20:05,739
Ain't that nice?

335
00:20:05,739 --> 00:20:10,619
There's no response from level one.

336
00:20:11,159 --> 00:20:12,519
Maybe they got wiped out.

337
00:20:12,779 --> 00:20:13,879
That can't be right.

338
00:20:14,359 --> 00:20:17,599
Vice Warden Hannibal told me that Warden Magellan released Shitty You.

339
00:20:17,799 --> 00:20:19,659
He sent him off to fight Blackbeard.

340
00:20:19,859 --> 00:20:20,859
He wouldn't lose.

341
00:20:20,959 --> 00:20:21,799
Not that quick.

342
00:20:21,799 --> 00:20:29,139
Even if the enemy is one of the seven warlords of the sea, Shitty You is a beast to be reckoned

343
00:20:29,139 --> 00:20:29,499
with.

344
00:20:30,959 --> 00:20:33,419
I've never heard the screams of a queen before.

345
00:20:33,859 --> 00:20:35,719
Oh, should be fun.

346
00:20:35,719 --> 00:20:39,619
A woman's weapons are not just her beauty.

347
00:20:40,139 --> 00:20:40,699
Observe.

348
00:20:41,639 --> 00:20:44,419
These lithe and delicate movements are weapons, too.

349
00:20:47,439 --> 00:20:47,999
Sad.

350
00:20:48,339 --> 00:20:52,279
Maybe you don't understand all of that because you're too busy cracking that whip around this

351
00:20:52,279 --> 00:20:53,079
way and that.

352
00:20:53,319 --> 00:20:56,019
But sensitivity is a virtue to embrace.

353
00:20:57,059 --> 00:20:57,579
Farewell.

354
00:20:57,799 --> 00:20:59,379
May your spirit rest in peace.

355
00:20:59,719 --> 00:21:00,659
Eva, please.

356
00:21:00,759 --> 00:21:01,859
Stop mourning for me.

357
00:21:01,859 --> 00:21:04,019
I may be down, but I'm not dead, you know.

358
00:21:05,739 --> 00:21:06,419
Let's see.

359
00:21:06,739 --> 00:21:07,519
Where was I?

360
00:21:07,699 --> 00:21:11,139
There are times when a woman's gifts can make her more powerful than any man.

361
00:21:11,259 --> 00:21:11,739
Enough!

362
00:21:12,059 --> 00:21:13,039
Red Viper whips!

363
00:21:15,659 --> 00:21:17,359
Too little, too late.

364
00:21:21,159 --> 00:21:25,139
I could take your head clean off right now, but where would be the fun in killing you

365
00:21:25,139 --> 00:21:27,159
before I get to hear you beg for mercy?

366
00:21:27,719 --> 00:21:29,799
Entertain me and we can do this nice and slow.

367
00:21:29,799 --> 00:21:32,199
Whimper until it builds into a scream.

368
00:21:32,499 --> 00:21:33,499
Stargear now!

369
00:21:36,179 --> 00:21:38,819
Stubborn queen, give me a scream.

370
00:21:39,179 --> 00:21:42,439
Come on, just one, because this will be your last!

371
00:21:46,639 --> 00:21:48,779
Ah, my bones.

372
00:21:49,239 --> 00:21:51,579
You shattered all my bones.

373
00:21:52,579 --> 00:21:53,099
Enough!

374
00:21:54,379 --> 00:21:56,179
Oh, sweet agony.

375
00:21:56,799 --> 00:21:57,639
Hard not!

376
00:21:57,639 --> 00:22:00,039
Enough jokes!

377
00:22:00,519 --> 00:22:01,179
No way!

378
00:22:01,379 --> 00:22:01,779
Oh!

379
00:22:02,359 --> 00:22:08,059
By injecting myself with my special Emporio female hormone, my body transformed into something

380
00:22:08,059 --> 00:22:12,839
both lithe and soft, allowing me to absorb any kind of shock, including your whip and that

381
00:22:12,839 --> 00:22:14,099
nasty pile of rocks.

382
00:22:14,639 --> 00:22:16,199
You dare defy me?

383
00:22:16,539 --> 00:22:18,999
Jeez, you have to throw me so hard?

384
00:22:19,139 --> 00:22:20,299
Hee-haw!

385
00:22:20,519 --> 00:22:20,639
Huh?

386
00:22:21,019 --> 00:22:21,739
What's that?

387
00:22:21,979 --> 00:22:23,099
She sounds just like Eva!

388
00:22:23,099 --> 00:22:26,139
Hurry, we're almost to the staircase leading to level three.

389
00:22:26,339 --> 00:22:27,959
I'll open the door once we're there.

390
00:22:28,119 --> 00:22:29,119
Got it, let's go!

391
