00:22:51,559 --> 00:22:52,559
Whoa!

411
00:22:52,559 --> 00:23:03,259
Who are you?

412
00:23:10,259 --> 00:23:13,799
Magellan reaches level four and closes in on Luffy's group.

413
00:23:14,339 --> 00:23:19,299
Caught in a pincer attack, Luffy and his companions try to reach the level three staircase by force,

414
